WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
- What did your daughters
think of "Frozen 2?"

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:02.750
They've seen it obviously, right?

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.583
- They saw it.

00:00:03.583 --> 00:00:06.750
They absolutely freaked out.

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:07.595
Loved it.

00:00:07.595 --> 00:00:08.428
- Aw!

00:00:08.428 --> 00:00:10.450
You're like the coolest dad ever to them.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.786
- No, usually they're not fans of me but,

00:00:12.786 --> 00:00:13.871
(laughing)

00:00:13.871 --> 00:00:15.617
with this movie,

00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:18.870
when they saw this my
oldest one looks at me

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.268
through like gritted teeth and she goes,

00:00:21.268 --> 00:00:23.085
"When can I see it again?

00:00:23.085 --> 00:00:25.209
(laughing)

00:00:25.209 --> 00:00:27.320
"I liked it more than the first one."

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:28.153
I'm like, thanks,

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:29.740
I didn't ask you for your
review but thank you.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:31.523
(laughing)

00:00:31.523 --> 00:00:32.940
- But kids will give you their review.

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.046
- Kids will give you their review.

00:00:34.046 --> 00:00:34.879
- Yes they will.

00:00:34.879 --> 00:00:35.770
- Like, what was the alternative?

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:37.325
Mm, hated that one.

00:00:37.325 --> 00:00:38.960
(laughing)

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.551
Is there still time to re-record daddy?

00:00:40.551 --> 00:00:41.384
(laughing)

00:00:41.384 --> 00:00:42.240
- Can you fix that?

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:43.170
- Can you fix that scene?

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:44.003
- My mom does that with this show.

00:00:44.003 --> 00:00:45.293
- The Samantha joke didn't track for me.

00:00:45.293 --> 00:00:46.857
- My mother does that this show,

00:00:46.857 --> 00:00:48.289
"Maybe you should put
your chair in the middle."

00:00:48.289 --> 00:00:49.507
(laughing)

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:52.100
I'm like, mom, there's a
reason why we did it this way.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.057
I love her, she's great.

00:00:53.057 --> 00:00:56.620
But I actually ruined
"Frozen" for my daughter.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:57.670
So when I did "Ugly Dolls,"

00:00:57.670 --> 00:00:58.503
it's an animated film,

00:00:58.503 --> 00:00:59.336
I was like yeah, you know,

00:00:59.336 --> 00:01:02.385
Mommy's the voice of Moxy
like you know how Elsa,

00:01:02.385 --> 00:01:04.820
the real singer and I started telling her

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:08.070
and then as I'm saying it, I just saw--

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:09.030
- It's trauma.

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:11.530
- I killed Christmas.

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:13.440
I killed everything in her heart.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.042
- I really believe that, yes you did.

00:01:15.042 --> 00:01:15.875
- I know!

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:16.828
(laughing)

00:01:16.828 --> 00:01:17.661
- And I really believe this.

00:01:17.661 --> 00:01:19.520
I really believe that if you,

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:21.480
cause I get stopped on
the street all the time

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:23.610
and loving parents come
up to me and they're like,

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:25.550
"I told him who you are."

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:27.583
And I'm like, I'm a 38 year old man.

00:01:27.583 --> 00:01:29.670
I don't know what you told them,

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:30.503
but they're like,

00:01:30.503 --> 00:01:31.739
"Do the Olaf thing."

00:01:31.739 --> 00:01:35.220
You can really only do it
for kids who are over ten.

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:36.340
If you're Mickey Mouse,

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:38.140
if you're the voice of Mickey Mouse,

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:39.630
and you've got like a thick beard

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:41.700
and you put a three
year old in front of him

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:44.539
and you're like, hey, Jim
over here is Mickey Mouse.

00:01:44.539 --> 00:01:46.310
And you see Jim be like,

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:47.143
all right give me a second,

00:01:47.143 --> 00:01:48.754
hi, how are ya kids?

00:01:48.754 --> 00:01:49.981
(laughing)

00:01:49.981 --> 00:01:51.691
- Oh my God that was so good!

00:01:51.691 --> 00:01:52.524
- Yeah.

00:01:52.524 --> 00:01:54.011
Hey, what are you up to?

00:01:54.011 --> 00:01:56.634
I gotta get back my wife is
waiting for me in the car.

00:01:56.634 --> 00:01:57.668
(laughing)

00:01:57.668 --> 00:01:58.763
Like, no!

00:01:58.763 --> 00:02:00.784
Don't do this to your children.

00:02:00.784 --> 00:02:02.113
- I know, I messed up.

00:02:02.113 --> 00:02:03.512
- I know, it's all right.
- I know.

